'''Exile's Resort''' (島流しリゾート ''Shimanagashi Rizōto'', '''Exile Resort''') is the 14th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 63rd sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 8.6 Update|Version 8.6]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter has a variety of stages, with the worst for most being [[A Private Rainforest]] ([[Cadaver Bear]]s + [[Brollow]]s). The others shouldn't cause too much trouble with the possible exception of [[Wonders of Nature]].

{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

